|game_text=* Deploys only on Tatooine for 2 Force from each player's Force Pile. Het is power +1 for each stormtrooper at same site, unless Reegesk is present.
|lore=Jawa scout. Wants to avenge deaths of relatives killed in stormtrooper assault on sandcrawler. Reegesk pilfered the powerpack from his blaster at a critical moment.
|errata_history=The archive capture, sheet edition and repository imports identify known source occurrences, not original first-publication days. The original first-publication order of potentially reused sheet and full images is not independently established.
