* [[Het Nkik (PC Errata 3)|Initial preserved full E]]: [[:File:ANH-L-hetnkik-holotable-by-2018-07-08.gif|full source]], present in the initial Holotable image import on 8 July 2018; that import is not a first-publication claim.
* [[Het Nkik (PC Errata 4)|Later full D-E1]]: [[:File:ANH-L-hetnkik-holotable-2024-01-27.png|current full source]], with the same corrected wording.
