* Unprinted rarity follows the [https://res.starwarsccg.org/cardlists/ANewHopeType.html official A New Hope card list]. The sheet edition and repository imports identify preserved source occurrences; they do not establish unknown first-publication days. In particular, the full face in the initial 2018 import may predate that import, so its original first-publication order relative to the 2017 partial is not independently established. The dated occurrences therefore do not independently settle their original publication sequence.
